# Consolidated ignore rules for all example projects.
#
# Patterns are RECURSIVE (**/…) so they cover build/generated ARTIFACTS
# regardless of the example's layout (functional or hierarchical). This
# replaces the ~40 per-directory .gitignore files that only matched fixed
# functional locations and stopped working after examples were flipped to
# hierarchical layout (e.g. obj_dir moving to prj/verif/).
#
# IMPORTANT: only build/generated ARTIFACTS are ignored here. Generated
# SOURCE (.cpp/.h/.sv/.svh/.cppm under model/ rtl/ tb/ base/ fw/
# verif/vl_wrap/ registrar/) and authored YAML are tracked and must stay
# visible — do not add patterns that would hide them.

# --- Verilator / C++ build ---
**/obj_dir/
**/*.a
**/*.o
**/*.d
**/build/
**/.gen/
**/.gen_file
**/*.scgen
**/*.svgen

# --- Databases (arch2code generator output) ---
**/*.db
**/.*.db

# --- Logs and waveforms ---
**/*.log
**/*.vcd

# --- Simulator run output ---
**/simx.*
**/.simvision/
**/regr/
**/out/

# --- Caches ---
**/.cache/
**/__pycache__/

# --- Generated docs (antora / graphviz / plantuml) ---
**/arch/*_specification/
**/arch/spec/modules/ROOT/images/
**/arch/spec/.blockDiagrams/
# Regenerated on doc build; keep porcelain clean.
**/arch/spec/modules/ROOT/pages/memory.adoc

# --- DVT ---
**/.dvt/*.xml
**/.dvt/*.ls
**/.dvt/.build_config_dict/*
**/dvt_build.log

# --- Docker cookie crumbs ---
**/.container-prerequisites
**/docker/Dockerfile

# --- Editor / OS ---
**/.vscode/
**/.clangd
**/compile_commands.json
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
